@baseUrl = http://localhost:5010/api
@token = replace-with-access-token

### Readiness: 200 when JWT configuration, database connectivity, and migrations are valid
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### No token must be rejected before database access
GET {{baseUrl}}/counts

### No token must be rejected before database access
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "depo-kullanici",
  "password": "replace-me"
}

### List counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/counts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a product
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Örnek ürün",
  "barcode": "8690000000000",
  "unit": "Adet",
  "company": null
}

### Get a count's system stock
GET {{baseUrl}}/counts/1/system-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a count's movements
GET {{baseUrl}}/counts/1/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a movement
POST {{baseUrl}}/counts/1/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uuid": "ad080953-2ee4-4eca-94de-d2751acd987b",
  "barcode": "8690000000000",
  "productName": "Örnek ürün",
  "quantity": 2,
  "comment": null
}

### Repeating the previous request with the same UUID is safe
POST {{baseUrl}}/counts/1/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uuid": "ad080953-2ee4-4eca-94de-d2751acd987b",
  "barcode": "8690000000000",
  "productName": "Örnek ürün",
  "quantity": 2,
  "comment": null
}
